    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        119.80740356445312,
        408.0729064941406,
        475.48358154296875,
        420.346923828125
      ],
      "text": "Screen for TB regularly, at each encounter with a health worker or visit to a health facility",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.8448181152344,
        526.23828125,
        450.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "Every adult and adolescent should be evaluated for eligibility to receive ART. Infection control measures should be prioritized to  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        450.5088195800781,
        335.2778015136719,
        460.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "reduce   transmission in all settings in which care is provided.  M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.8448181152344,
        526.26171875,
        470.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "Chest radiography can be done if available, particularly for people living with HIV on ART, but is not required to classify patients into  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        470.5088195800781,
        526.2574462890625,
        480.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "TB and non-TB groups. In settings with a high HIV prevalence and a high TB prevalence among people living with HIV (e.g. > 10%),",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        480.5088195800781,
        344.0644226074219,
        490.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "strong consideration should be given to adding other, sensitive investigations.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.8448181152344,
        526.1690673828125,
        500.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "Contraindications include: active hepatitis (acute or chronic), regular and heavy alcohol consumption and symptoms of peripheral  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        500.5088195800781,
        526.2149047851562,
        510.74884033203125
      ],
      "text": "neuropathy. History of TB and current pregnancy should not be contraindications for starting preventive treatment. Although LTBI",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        510.50885009765625,
        504.27178955078125,
        520.7488403320312
      ],
      "text": "testing is not a requirement for initiating preventive treatment, it may be done as a part of eligibility screening where feasible.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.8447875976562,
        526.210205078125,
        530.7488403320312
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF should be used as the initial diagnostic test for TB. Detailed algorithms for people living with HIV suspected of having  d",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        530.5088500976562,
        526.2337036132812,
        540.7488403320312
      ],
      "text": "TB are available in the WHO consolidated guidelines on the use of antiretroviral drugs for treating and preventing HIV infection",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        540.5088500976562,
        365.6986083984375,
        550.7488403320312
      ],
      "text": "(http://apps.who.int/iris/bitstream/10665/208825/1/9789241549684_eng.pdf).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.8447875976562,
        357.3988342285156,
        560.7488403320312
      ],
      "text": "Resume regular screening for TB after completion of treatment for active disease.  e",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.18505859375,
        237.7548828125,
        609.6890258789062
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.0076293945312,
        526.6782836914062,
        625.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "Overall, the GDG agreed that the four-symptom screening rule is very useful for ruling out active TB before",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.0076293945312,
        526.6150512695312,
        639.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "providing preventive treatment to people living with HIV, regardless of whether they receive ART. It noted the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.0076293945312,
        526.7013549804688,
        653.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "potential benefits of adding an abnormal chest radiographic finding to the four-symptom screening rule, while",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.0076293945312,
        526.6693115234375,
        667.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "recognizing a marginal improvement in performance. Moreover, increased use of chest radiography would",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0076293945312,
        526.6383056640625,
        681.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "add more false-positive results to the screening rule, which would require more investigations for TB and other",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.0076293945312,
        526.6741333007812,
        695.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "illnesses. Therefore, the GDG reiterated that chest radiography should be added as an additional investigation",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.0076293945312,
        526.7442016601562,
        709.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "only if it does not pose a barrier to the provision of preventive treatment for people living with HIV. Although",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.0076293945312,
        526.6091918945312,
        723.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "no study was found of the additive role of chest radiography in testing pregnant women, the GDG noted that",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.0076293945312,
        526.67236328125,
        737.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "pregnant women living with HIV could also benefit, as long as good clinical practices are observed to prevent",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        739.0076293945312,
        222.00607299804688,
        751.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "any significant risk to the fetus  .   (31)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
